<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Boeing,McDonnell,CSA join in Aero tender.</title>
<headline>Boeing,McDonnell,CSA join in Aero tender.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co, McDonnell Douglas and Czech airlines  Ceske Aerolinie a.s. said on Thursday they submitted a joint bid in a tender for a 34-40 percent stake in Czech jet maker Aero Vodochody a.s..</p>
<p>A statement released through a local public relations office said the consortium offered to use Aero facilities to make spare parts for Boeing civilian planes and in assembling components for McDonnell Douglas' F/A 18 supersonic fighters.</p>
